        },
        {
            "heading": "Ambition opinion",
            "level": 3,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Ambitious characters have an additional -25 opinion modifier toward characters they desire something from, stacking with the following negative opinion modifiers:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Title claimant",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Desires <title>",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "text": "Direct de jure liege title is held by liege, and does not contain the liege's capital",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Direct de jure vassal title is held by liege",
                                    "children": []
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Desires control of <title>",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "text": "\"One of your vassals has, as their primary title, a title that is my direct de jure vassal\"",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "A vassal transfer will fix this and also add \"vassal transfer: +10\" for 10 years",
                                    "children": []
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Too many held elector titles (more than one de jure duchy, or more than one de jure kingdom)",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Ambition opinion is also active against a liege while a character is plotting to fabricate a claim on their liege's title . If a vassal is \"-25 Ambitious\" toward their liege and shows no reason to be, they are probably using this plot."
                }
            ]
        },
